{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 139,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah, thou hast searched me, and known ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou knowest my downsitting and mine uprising;\nThou understandest my thought afar off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou searchest out my path and my lying down,\nAnd art acquainted with all my ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For there is not a word in my tongue,\nBut, lo, O Jehovah, thou knowest it altogether.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast beset me behind and before,\nAnd laid thy hand upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Such",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge is too wonderful for me;\nIt is high, I cannot attain unto it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whither shall I go from thy Spirit?\nOr whither shall I flee from thy presence?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I ascend up into heaven, thou art there:\nIf I make my bed in Sheol, behold, thou art there.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I take the wings of the morning,\nAnd dwell in the uttermost parts of the sea;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even there shall thy hand lead me,\nAnd thy right hand shall hold me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I say, Surely the darkness shall overwhelm me,And the light about me shall be night;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even the darkness hideth not from thee,\nBut the night shineth as the day:\nThe darkness and the light are both alike ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou didst form my inward parts:\nThou didst cover me in my mother’s womb.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will give thanks unto thee; for I am fearfully and wonderfully made:\nWonderful are thy works;\nAnd that my soul knoweth right well.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My frame was not hidden from thee,\nWhen I was made in secret,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " curiously wrought in the lowest parts of the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thine eyes did see mine unformed substance;\nAnd in thy book they were all written,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the days that were ordained ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",\nWhen as yet there was none of them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How precious also are thy thoughts unto me, O God!\nHow great is the sum of them!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I should count them, they are more in number than the sand:\nWhen I awake, I am still with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely thou wilt slay the wicked, O God:\nDepart from me therefore, ye bloodthirsty men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they speak against thee wickedly,\nAnd thine enemies take ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy name",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in vain.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do not I hate them, O Jehovah, that hate thee?\nAnd am not I grieved with those that rise up against thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I hate them with perfect hatred:\nThey are become mine enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Search me, O God, and know my heart:\nTry me, and know my thoughts;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.139.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.139.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And see if there be any wicked way in me,\nAnd lead me in the way everlasting.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "God’s omnipresence and omniscience.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician. A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
